<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">ND - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">End</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ndûlù</para>
  <para style="toc1">ENDÛLÙ</para>
  <para style="h">Endûlù</para>
  <para style="mt1">ENDÛLÙ</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Eci Citabu c'Endûlù cayandikagwa na muntu muguma oku burhegesi n’obuhabûzi bwa Mukà Mutagatîfu. Oyo muntu alamaga omu Palestina-Israheli embere ly’okulibuzibwa kwa Yeruzalemu, omu mwâka gwa 587, embere ly’okuburhwa kwa Kristu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Endûlù zibà nyimbo za mishîbo. Abayahudi bakâgiziyimba amango gw’oburherekêre omu ka-Nyamuzinda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Endûlù, zibà nyimbo za kumanyîsa oku Yeruzalemu n’abantu ba muli ye balibuzibwa. Ecitabu c’endûlù ciyêrekana oburhè bw’okunali haguma n’obulangâlire: «Nyamuzinda abà Mwinjà oku bayishimulinda» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LAM 3:25">3, 25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekleziya Katolika ekolêsa Endûlù omu Liturjiya ly’Omugobe Mutagatîfu, ogu rhukengeramwo okulibuzibwa kwa Yezu Kristu.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="ip">Omu Citabu c'Endûlù mubà bigabi birhanu:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Endûlù ntanzi: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 1">1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Endûlù ya kabirhi: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 2">2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Endûlù ya kasharhu: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 3">3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Endûlù ya kani: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 4">4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Endûlù ya karhanu: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="LAM 5">5</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù ntanzi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1"/>Yajêwe! Alà gulya murhundu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogu murhundu gw’e Yeruzalemu. Omuzihi aliaderha obwôrhere bugalugalu Yeruzalemu âjà mwo erhi bubî bwâge burhuma.</char></note> gwayunjulaga bantu mîra oku gukola guyoôsire gwône! Gulya gwagwêrhe irenge kulya omu gandi mashanja, gukola guli nka mukana. Nnjo erhi ali muluzi-nyere okulîre ebishagala, lêro akolesibwe obukûkuru bw’abajà.<verse eid="LAM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2"/>Akola ageza obudufu bwoshi alaka, amarhama gâge gakazihulula mirenge. Muli balya bamuzigiraga boshi, ntâye ciru n’omuguma w’okumurhûliriza. Abîra bâge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abîra ba Yûda ba mîra, balya anywânanaga nabo mpu bakamurhabâla; lêro boshi bamâmulekêrera. Lolà muli <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 4:30">Yer 4, 30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:14">30, 14</ref></char>: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 16:37-40">Eze 16, 37-40</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:22-29">23, 22-29</ref></char>. </char></note> boshi bamulesire, bahindusirage bashombanyi bâge.<verse eid="LAM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3"/>Yûda amâhêkwa ihanga lya bene mpu alibuzibwe n’okulembera obujà: Ayûbasire ekarhî k’entakembûlwa, ntà bushagaluke agwêrhe. Abakagimulibuza boshi bàmugwanyanyize bamugwârhira omu maganya gâge.<verse eid="LAM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4"/>Enjira z’e Siyoni ziri omu mishîbo, zalesirwe na balya bakâgiyishija oku lusiku lukulu. Emihango yâge yoshi eri bwâmwa, abadâhwa bâge bali omu mulenge. Ensûli zâge zatwisire omurhima. Alà oku ebyo byoshi byâdarhabalira Siyoni yâga!<verse eid="LAM 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5"/>Abashombanyi bâge bo bahimire, abanzi bâge badêkerîre. Nyakasane oyo wamubabazize erhi bugamba bwâge bunji burhuma. Abagala barhôrhô bajà batundulikwa n’omubisha wabagwâsire mpira abahêka bujà.<verse eid="LAM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6"/>Siyoni amâbona oku ebyakagirhuma aj’irenge byagenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 10:18">Eze 10, 18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:22">11, 22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:37">16, 37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 47:3">Iz 47, 3</ref></char>.</char></note>. Abarhambo bâge bakola bali nka rhushafu rhwabuzire akahasi rhwakera, rhulya rhwajà rhwayâka omuhivi rhurhanacigwêrhi misî ya kulibirha.<verse eid="LAM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7"/>Mw’ezo nsiku z’amababale n’obuhanya bwâge, Yeruzalemu akazike­ngêra birya azigiraga byoshi, birya byàli by’omu nsiku za mîra. Erhi abantu bâge boshi bakaz’ihirima oku bwôji bw’engôrho y’omushomba­nyi, hanabulikana ciru n’omuntu muguma w’okubarhabâla.<verse eid="LAM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8"/>Yeruzalemu akozire amaligo manene bwenêne, co cirhumire akola ali wa kushologorhana. Abamukengaga lêro badwîrhe bamugayaguza, ene babona akola ali bushungunu. Asigalirage okukaziyâma kwône n’okuhinduka ashubira nyuma.<verse eid="LAM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9"/>Omwambalo gwâge gunanirekwo ebirhobero by’izinga lyâge. Arhàli amanyire bici byâmuyishira; ntyo kwo ayandagîre, ntà muntu wacimuhà omurhima. Amâderha erhi: «Mâshi Nyakasane, lolà buno buhanya bundikwo: obone oku omushombanyi wâni ye wahimîne.»<verse eid="LAM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10"/>Omubisha ahêsire obuhiri bwâge bwoshi omu nfune. Ciru anabwîne n’oku abapagani bayenjerera omu cirhînyiro ca Nyakasane. N’obwo, Yâgirwa Nyakasane, wêne wahanzagya mpu irhondo abo bapagani barhajaga ahantu h’endêko yâwe.<verse eid="LAM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11"/>Olubaga lwa Yeruzalemu ludwîrhe lwayâma lwalonza eci lwalya. Ludwîrhe lwahâna akantu luzigira kulusha, luhâbwè eci lwalya lubonemwo amagala n’emisî. Lwamâshenga erhi: «Olole Nyakasane, kuno ndwîrhe nagayaguzibwa.»<verse eid="LAM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12"/>Mwe mudwîrhe mwagera omu njira mweshi, mulole ninyu erhi hali amalibuko gali nk’aga gandikwo, aga Nyakasane ampiragakwo omu lusiku lw’obukunizi bwâge budârhi.<verse eid="LAM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13"/>Kurhenga enyanya ambulagire omuliro omu rhuvuha rhwâni, rhwanayabirwa nagwo. Antezire akasirha mpu angwâse amagulu, anankuba. Anjizire muntu wâgo wâgo, na mulwâla buca buyira.<verse eid="LAM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14"/>Amabî najizire arhagarhenzakwo isù, gayosire nka kuno agonya ecifundo omu kuboko kwâge, gasosire gahika omu igosi lyâni. Nyakasane afu­nyâzize emisî yâni ampâna omu maboko g’abashombanyi, balya ntà­ nkahasha.<verse eid="LAM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15"/>Abasirika b’entwâli nagwêrhe abajugucîre nka bikabulirwa. Antumira omurhwe gw’abalwî mpu bahinage emisole yâni. Niono Siyoni w’omu Yûda, ampinazire nka kula banahinagira emizâbîbu omu mukenzi.<verse eid="LAM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16"/>Obwo buhanya bwo burhunire ndwîrhe nalaka emirenge yâni yoshi. Owakantûliriza ashubingalulira emisî y’okulama, ali kulî. Abâna bâni balesirwe maboko mûmu, bulya omushombanyi abahimire.<verse eid="LAM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17"/>Siyoni adwîrhe alambûla amaboko, ci ntâye ciru n’omuguma abwîne w’okumurhûliriza. Oku irhegeko lya Nyakasane, abalungu b’Israheli bo bahindusire bashombanyi bâge. Muli bo Yeruzalemu ahindusirage kantu ka kushologosa.<verse eid="LAM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18"/>Nyakasane ye Mushinganyanya. bulya nagomîre irhegeko lyâge. Mwe muli hano mweshi, muyumve bwinjà, munalole gano mababale gâni: ensûli zâni n’emisole yâni bakola ebwa kulibuzibwa ihanga.<verse eid="LAM 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19"/>Nahamagîre abanzigiraga, kurharhumire barhandeka nahirima. Abadâhwa bâni n’abahanûzi bâni baholîre omu cishagala, n’obwo kulonza bajaga balonza eci balya mpu hashubibonamwo emisî.<verse eid="LAM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20"/>Nyakasane, olole, obone mababale manganaci gano gangwêrhe obulà buli bwajugumana na buno omurhima gubangalîre, bulya nakugomîre kubî bwenêne! Engôrho yanyukîze abâna omu njira, n’omu nyumpa mifù yône yône elambamire. <verse eid="LAM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21"/>Oyumve kuno ndwîrhe nahûmagukwa, ntâye ciru n’omuguma w’oku­ ntûliriza. Abashombanyi bâni boshi bàyumvîrhe emyanzi y’obuhanya bwâni, bàcîshinga kuli okûla wanjizire. Olerhage lulya lusiku waderhaga, nabo babè kuno nabîre. <verse eid="LAM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22"/>Obubî bwâbo bwoshi buyâlagale embere zâwe, obakolere nabo nk’ebîra wankolîre erhi bugamba bwâni burhuma. Obwîne oku malumwa gano gône gandikwo, omurhima gwâni gwababîre lwoshi.<verse eid="LAM 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù ya kabirhi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1"/>Yajêwe! Nyakasane omu bukunizi bwâge bunene anabwîne ecitù ciru e­nyanya za Yeruzalemu. Eryâli irenge ly’Israheli, alijugucîre oku idaho kurhenga enyanya empingu. Amango oburhè bwâge bwabirûnduka kuli Siyoni, ayibagira oku co càli citumbi c’okuhirakwo amagulu gâge.<verse eid="LAM 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2"/>Nyakasane amirangusize omwîmo gwa Yakôbo gwoshi buzira lukogo. Omu bukunizi bwâge, anahongwîre ebishagala bizibubizibu bya Yûda byoshi, obwâmi n’ababurhegeka boshi ahemwîre, abirhimba oku idaho.<verse eid="LAM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3"/>lhembe Israheli alimbagamwo, analivunyire omu bukunizi bwâge budârhi, alahira kufungira olubaga erhi lurhêrwa n’omushombanyi.<verse eid="LAM 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4"/>Afôzire omuherho gwâge nka mushombanyi, okuboko kwâge kulyo kuli­ nguzize okulasha. Anaciyêrekîne mushombanyi wîrhu bulya amâhungumula ebyakagirhusîmisa. Adubulire omutula gwâge nka muliro oku ka-Nyamuzinda ka Yeruzalemu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nk’omu <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 12:7">Yer 12, 7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 30:14">30, 14</ref></char>; bayêresire Nyakasane nka mushombanyi wa lubaga lwâge lwîshogwa: Israheli.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5"/>Nyakasane anacîjizire nka mushombanyi wîrhu, amirangusize Israheli oku caligumiza haguma n’enyumpa zâge nyinjinjà zoshi, ebyôgo byâge abihebire oku idaho, ajà alumîza oburhè hoshi hoshi omu lubaga lw’e Yûda.<verse eid="LAM 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6"/>Ahugunyire olugurhu lw’ishwa lyâge, ashâba ahantu akâgirhubugâna. Nyakasane ayibagizize ensiku nkulu n’eza Sabato e Siyoni. Mw’okwo kubîka omutula gwâge agayaguza ciru na mwâmi n’abadâhwa.<verse eid="LAM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7"/>Nyakasane arhacilonza oluhêrero lwâge, analesire ahantu hâge hatagatîfu, enyumpa nyinjinjà z’e Siyoni analesire zarhibukira omu maboko g’omushombanyi. Olubî lwàli lunji bwenêne omu ka-Nyamuzinda nka kula binayôrha amango g’olusiku lukulu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eco cihôgêro cirhàli ca mwishingo nka kulya bashamambira, bagashâniza olusiku lukulu, ci càli ca bashombanyi balirhêra aka-Nyamuzinda.</char></note><verse eid="LAM 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8"/>Nyakasane ali ahizire okusherêza ebisîka bya Yeruzalemu. Alambwîre omugozi gw’okugalagaza, àrhacîsire okuboko kwâge mpu kurhashâbaga. Ci ebyôgo n’ebisîka abihebire omu mishîbo. Byashubire migandu byoshi haguma.<verse eid="LAM 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9"/>Emihango y’ecishagala yahongosire, orhuhamikizo rhwâco rhwoshi arhuvungunywîre. Mwâmi n’abarhambo bagwîre omu maboko g’abapagani banyamahanga. Ntâye ciru n’omuguma w’okuderha ebi Nyamuzinda alonza; ciru n’abalêbi barhacimanya obulêbi bwarhenga emwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="LAM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10"/>Abahanûzi b’e Siyoni babwârhîre oku idaho banaguguma, amarhwe gâbo bagashîzire omutulo banayambala babusunzu. N’ensûli z’e Yeruzalemu zayûnamîre oku idaho.<verse eid="LAM 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11"/>Amasù gâni garhûnzire n’okulaka emirenge, omurhima gundimwo gwarhozire, ntankabula bwaziguluka kw’obu buhanya bwamarhinda oku lubaga lwâni, bulya abâna b’ebirhaba n’abaciri oku ibêre badwîrhe bafîra omu ngo z’ebishagala n’enyôrha.<verse eid="LAM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12"/>Abâna badwîrhe badôsa bannina, mpu: «Ka ntà kantu kalîbwa ka­ nkaciboneka?» Erhi banajà bahirima nk’abatumirhîrwe omu njira z’ebishagala banarhengeremwo omûka omu bifuba bya nnina.<verse eid="LAM 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13"/>Ntacimanyiri kurhi nankakubwîra yâga Yeruzalemu, obwôrhere bwâwe burhashushini na bundi buhi! Ndigi nankakushushanya naye, nti lyo nkurhûliriza we munyere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Munyere w’e Siyoni»: ko kuderha Yeruzalemu.</char></note> w’e Siyoni? Obuhanya bwâwe buli bunene nka nyanja, ndigi wankacikufumya?<verse eid="LAM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14"/>Abalêbi bâwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Abalêbi bâwe»: Balêbi b’obunywesi, halya hàdesire eby’obunywesi.</char></note> barhakulêberaga ebirhali bya bunywesi, babula kukuvuhûlira obubî bwâwe, mpu bakugalulire akalamo k’iragi. Emyanzi yâbo kuli we bwwanali bunywesi bwône bwône n’obuhalanjisi.<verse eid="LAM 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15"/>Abadwîrhe bagera omu njira bakazikoma kagasha boshi, badwîrhe bakubandira olwôho we Yeruzalemu, banakudundira irhwe baderhe, mpu: Ka ko binali co cirya cishagala bakâgiderha mpu «Cinjinja buzira izâbyo na busîme bw’igulu lyoshi eci wâni?»<verse eid="LAM 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16"/>Abashombanyi bâwe boshi badwîrhe bakushanyangulira, bakugurhe amîno baderhe, mpu: «Rhwamâmuherêrekeza! Lwo lulya lusiku rhwakagicîfinja kurhenga mîra olu. Lwahisirage lêro nîrhu, rhwalubwînagel»<verse eid="LAM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17"/>Nyakasane anakozire ebi àkagihiga, ayunjuzize akanwa àderhaga kurhenga mîra. Anashâbwîre buzira lukogo, asîmîsize omushombanyi n’obuhanya bwâwe, azibuhize obucîbone bw’omubisha wâwe.<verse eid="LAM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18"/>Yeruzalemu, osôkeze endûlù z’okulaka kwâwe emwa Nyakasane. Oleke emirenge ekuhulule omu marhama nka nshalalo ngasi mûshi na budufu. Orhagohekaga walaka, emirenge yâwe erhahubaga.<verse eid="LAM 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19"/>Yimanga, obande endûlù budufu, gala mango bayîza, odubulire omurhima gwâwe nka mîshi embere za Nyakasane. Omulambûlire amabo­ko, ly’ociza obuzîne bw’abâna bâwe b’ebirhaba, balya bajà baholera n’ishali omu mashango g’enjira zoshi.<verse eid="LAM 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20"/>Nyakasane, lolà obone ndi ojirîre ntyo. Mâshi Nyakasane, kurhi abakazi bankahika cingana aha, kulya abâna boburhaga bône banabalera? Ku­erhi abashombanyi bankalinda bahika aha kuyîrhira abadâhwa n’abalêbi omu cirhînyiro câwe?<verse eid="LAM 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21"/>Emisole n’abashosi bajîre balambama oku idaho omu njira, abâna­-rhabana bâni n’abâna-nyere bahwêrire oku bwôji bw’engôrho. Wàbayîsire omu lusiku lw’omutula gwâwe, wanigûza buzira lukogo.<verse eid="LAM 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22"/>Abashombanyi bâni badârhi wabalalisire nk’oku lusiku lukulu. Yâgirwa Nyakasane, olusiku omutula gwâwe gwabashaga, harhajiraga omuntu wasigala erhi ashugunuke. Omushombanyi àhungumwîre abâna naleraga nanakazagihêka emugongo.<verse eid="LAM 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù ya kasharhu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1"/>Nie muntu wabwîne amalumwa g’akarhi k’obukunizi bwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="LAM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2"/>Ansunika embere zâge, angeza omu mwizimya, buzira kamole.<verse eid="LAM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3"/>Niene niene acikubûlîre okuboko buca buyira.<verse eid="LAM 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4"/>Arhumire omubiri gwâni gwahorha kurhangirira oku irhwe kuhika omu magulu, amvunyungwîre orhuvuha.<verse eid="LAM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5"/>Ayimanzize eciri nka côgo ca malumwa n’amalibuko eburhambi bwâni.<verse eid="LAM 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6"/>Anjugucîre omu mwizimya nka mufù gwa mîra-mîra.<verse eid="LAM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7"/>Anjirîre ecisikirizo mpu cimpanze okurhengamwo, anziriringa n’obudagulè.<verse eid="LAM 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8"/>Nayâmire namuhamagala, ci omusengero gwâni arhaguyumvîrhîze.<verse eid="LAM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9"/>Anfukîre enjira n’amabuye magôye, enjira zâni aziyêrekeza ebwa kuhabuka.<verse eid="LAM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10"/>Anambêrîre nka mpangaza elingûzize, nka ntale ecifulisire omu ishaka.<verse eid="LAM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11"/>Enjira zâni azihindwîre: anandesire; ansizire kahumba, côbohwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12"/>Afôzire omuherho gwâge, antega mpu ankoze.<verse eid="LAM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13"/>Anantulungwîre ensiko nieshi n’ebisonga byâge.<verse eid="LAM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14"/>Abantu boshi badwîrhe banshekera, lwâni ludwîrhe lwayimbwa buca­ buyira.<verse eid="LAM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15"/>Anyunjuzize malumwa, andalusize n’omutula.<verse eid="LAM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16"/>Anansêzize okukugurha olukalabuye, anantindagirira omu katulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Kukugurha olukalabuye» ko kugalanjuka omu luvù.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17"/>Anyasize akalamo k’omurhûla, nayibagira iragi kwo kuderha kurhi.<verse eid="LAM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18"/>Naderha nti; «Ntà kalamo nacibone, ntâbyo ncilangâlîre by’emwa Nyakasane».<verse eid="LAM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19"/>Kengêra amalumwa gâni n’obuhanya bwâni, ko buli nka bôge bwashakamira.<verse eid="LAM 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20"/>Omurhima gwâni erhi gubikengêra, nieshi nnanjogonokerwe ebirumbu.<verse eid="LAM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21"/>Ci kwonô, kwo nkolaga nakengêra ntya, kurhume nalangâlira.<verse eid="LAM 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22"/>Olukogo lwa Nyakasane lurhacîkwa, obuzigire bwâge burhaheka.<verse eid="LAM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23"/>Olukogo lwâge lushâshuka ngasi sêzi. Alà oku obwîkubagirwa bwâwe bwaluga, Nyakasane!<verse eid="LAM 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24"/>Kwo ndesire: nti «Nyakasane ye kuhirhira kwâni, co cirhumire mmulangâlira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«igwârhiro ly’okulangâlira ciru n’omu malibuko»: sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:5">Lul 16, 5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:26">73, 26</ref></char>. 3, 30; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Iz 50, 6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mat 5, 39</ref></char>.</char></note>».<verse eid="LAM 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25"/>Nyakasane abà mwinjà kuli ngasi yêshi umuyegemera, olya omulo­ngereza.<verse eid="LAM 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26"/>Kuli kwinjà okulangâlira omu kahwenyenye obucire Nyakasane ârhuma.<verse eid="LAM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27"/>Kuli kwinjà oku muntu okubarhula omuzigo gwa Nyakasane kurhengera oburhò bwâge.<verse eid="LAM 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28"/>Aciyungulîre omu kahwenyenye amango Nyakasane amuhizireko amarhangulo.<verse eid="LAM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29"/>Ayunamirize kuhika amime akatulo, omu kulangâlira oku Nyakasane ayishimurhabâla.<verse eid="LAM 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30"/>Irhama lyâge aliyêrekeze owamushûrha, anayêmêre bamuyiguse bijâci <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mat 5, 39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Iz 50, 6</ref></char>. 3, 32: Abashi mpu: «Engoko enalabarhe omwâna wâyo erhi enamubwîne»: Nyamuzinda ye muzîre «Ntahwa lukogo».</char></note><verse eid="LAM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31"/>Bulya Nyakasane arhabà wa kukabulira omuntu omu nsiku zoshi.<verse eid="LAM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32"/>Bulya ciru ankamubabaza, kurharhuma arhamubabalira omu lukogo lwâge lunene.<verse eid="LAM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33"/>Bulya omurhima gwâge gurhasîma kugayisa abantu erhi kubarhindibuza.<verse eid="LAM 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34"/>Gala mango balabarhanya ababohe b’omu cihugo boshi.<verse eid="LAM 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35"/>Amango bagorombekanya olubanja lw’abanyinyi omu masù g’Ow’Enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="LAM 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36"/>Amango bayîmira omuntu okuli kwâge ekagombe; ka Nyakasane arhabona ebyo byoshi obwo?<verse eid="LAM 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37"/>Ndi wankahashiderha akanwa kanabè? K’arhali Nyakasane ohiga?<verse eid="LAM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38"/>K’arhali kanwa ka Nyamuzinda w’Enyanya bwenêne kazûsa byoshi, ebibî n’ebinja?<verse eid="LAM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39"/>Bicigi lêro omuntu ankacîdudumira, akabà acizîne, n’obwo agwêrhe mabî manji?<verse eid="LAM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40"/>Rhulole bwinjinjà olugendo lwîrhu, rhushubire emwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="LAM 3:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41"/>Rhushenge n’omurhima gwîrhu gwoshi, rhuyinamulire amaboko emwa Nyamuzinda oli omu mpingu.<verse eid="LAM 3:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42"/>Rhwabîre babî na bagoma; nâwe orharhubabaliraga kuli okwo.<verse eid="LAM 3:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43"/>Wacibwîkira omu bukunizi bwâwe, warhushimbulula, wanigûza buzira lukogo.<verse eid="LAM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44"/>Wacîyegulira enyuma ly’ecitù, mpu lyo ensengero zîrhu zirhagikuhikakwo.<verse eid="LAM 3:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45"/>Warhujizire bikabulirwa, nka câmvu, omu karhî k’agandi mashanja.<verse eid="LAM 3:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46"/>Abashombanyi bîrhu boshi bakazibumbûla akanwa barhusholoshonza.<verse eid="LAM 3:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47"/>Ecôbà gwo gukolaga mwanya gwîrhu, kuhugalala, kusherêra, buhanya bwêne bwône.<verse eid="LAM 3:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48"/>Amasù gâni gadwîrhe gahona nshalalo ya mirenge, erhi buhanya bw’olubaga lwâni burhuma.<verse eid="LAM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49"/>Amasù gâni yabîre nshôko erhahuba, garhâgoheka.<verse eid="LAM 3:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50"/>Ndwîrhe nalinga oku Nyakasane ayûnama kurhenga enyanya, alolereze anabone:<verse eid="LAM 3:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51"/>Ebi byarhinzire oku banyere b’omu cishagala ciru biri bya kundumîsa amasù.<verse eid="LAM 3:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52"/>Abanshombera obusha bajà bampiva nka kanyunyi.<verse eid="LAM 3:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53"/>Bantogîze omu mwîna nandi mugumagumà, bahira ibuye enyanya zâni.<verse eid="LAM 3:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54"/>Amîshi gakazinzungulira aha nyanya z’irhwe; lêro naderha nti namâhera.<verse eid="LAM 3:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55"/>Nakuyâkûzize kurhenga omu kuzimu, Nyakasane.<verse eid="LAM 3:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56"/>Wanyumvîrhe oku nakubirikira: orhafukaga amarhwîri gâwe oku nsengero zâni n’ndûlù yâni.<verse eid="LAM 3:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57"/>Amango nakuhamagalaga wanyegera wanabwîra, erhi: «Orhayôbohaga».<verse eid="LAM 3:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58"/>We wambulânire, Nyakasane waciza obuzîne bwâni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyamuzinda ye «mucunguzi» w’olubaga lwâge.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 3:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59"/>Obwîne obubî banjirîre, Nyakasane, ontwîre luno lubanja.<verse eid="LAM 3:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60"/>Wabwîne oku bacîhôla kuli nie, wabwîne emihigo yâbo kuli nie.<verse eid="LAM 3:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61"/>Wayumvîrhe ebijâci byâbo, Nyakasane, n’emihigo yâbo mibî kuli nie.<verse eid="LAM 3:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62"/>Enshambâlo n’enkegêro mbî z’abashombanyi bâni nie zidwîrhe zagerako buca-buyîra.<verse eid="LAM 3:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63"/>Obone ebi badwîrhe bajira byoshi, nie nashubirage lwimbo lwâbo.<verse eid="LAM 3:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64"/>Nyakasane, wayishibakolera ebiri nk’ebi bàmkolîre.<verse eid="LAM 3:64"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65"/>Wâbatubâza obukengêre, gubè mulagi gwâwe mubî kuli bo.<verse eid="LAM 3:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66"/>Wâbashimbûlula n’obukunizi bwâwe, obaherêrekeze lwoshi hano igulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù ya kani</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1"/>Yoo! amasholo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amasholo n’amabuye matagatîfu, cimanyîso c’olubaga lw’e Yeruzalemu</char></note> galangashana kulya, ecûma cinjinja kulya, kurhi lêro catubîre wâni? Kurhi amabuye matagatîfu gàjire gashandala hoshi hoshi omu mashango ga ngasi njira?<verse eid="LAM 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2"/>Abâna b’e Siyoni, abayumananaga n’amasholo oku bwinjà, kurhi lêro ba­nkagereragwa oku nyungu buyungu y’ebidaka?<verse eid="LAM 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3"/>Ciru na banyambwè bajira omurhima gw’okuhà abâna bâbo ibêre. Ci kwône olubaga lwâni lwabîre muzîre wa cihûngo ak’enyûnda z’omu irungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 39:13-17">Ayu 39, 13-17</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4"/>Abâna baciri oku ibêre, olulimi lwabayumîre ebiraka n’ecûmwe, abâna b’ebirhaba badwîrhe bahûna omugati na ntâye wabahà ciru n’ehihimbi hyâgwo.<verse eid="LAM 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5"/>Abakagirya ebinja-binjà bishushagîre, lêro bajà balengukira omu njira. Abalereragwa omu by’obugale, bakola bajà bafukula ecavu n’amabo­ko gombi.<verse eid="LAM 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6"/>Amabî g’olubaga lwâni go manene kulusha ebyâha by’abantu b’e Sodomo, bo bàbirundulagwa omu kanya kasungunu buzira ciru n’amango g’okulambûla amaboko mpu babarhabâle.<verse eid="LAM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7"/>Abaluzi bâlwo bo balangashanaga kulusha olubula, enshusho yâbo yali nyêru kulusha amarhà, n’omubiri gwâbo gwoshi gwàli gwa kaduku. Emisî ebalanganyiremwo yakagishusha enjuma y’akasi.<verse eid="LAM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8"/>Lêro bakola bali bîru-bîru nka muyeye, barhacidwîrhi bamanywa omu njira. Ecikoba c’omubiri gwâbo cikola cibananîre oku rhuvuha, cikola cûmu-cûmu bushâli.<verse eid="LAM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9"/>Okuhirima oku bwôji bw’engôrho kwo kukulu aha omuntu ankafà n’obu­ligo ajà ayûma anagangabala n’ishali.<verse eid="LAM 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10"/>Abazîre, oku barhahimwa lukogo, lêro bôhe, bakaziyenda abâna bâbo banabalya, mw’obwo buhanya bunene bwarhogîre oku lubaga lwâni.<verse eid="LAM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11"/>Nyakasane ayûkirize omutula gwâge, adubwîre obukunizi bwâge bunene, ayâsize ntakanjirwa w’engulumira omu Siyoni àyôkera ciru n’ebiriba byoshi.<verse eid="LAM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12"/>Abâmi b’igulu ciru n’abantu kwône en’igulu ntâye ciru n’omuguma wankayêmîre oku hali lusiku luguma omushombanyi ankahimire agere omu mihango ya Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13"/>Obwo buhanya budwîrhwe n’ebyâha by’abalêbi bâge, haguma n’amabî g’abadâhwa bâge, bo babulagaga omukò gw’abantu bimâna.<verse eid="LAM 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14"/>Badwîrhage bajà bahukuza omu njira nka mihûrha, n’emyambalo yâbo ezinzire n’omukò.<verse eid="LAM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15"/>Erhi bacibà bagera, abantu bababona banayâkûze abâbo, mpu: «Muyâke, muyâke, abo bali b’izinga! Muyâke, murhabayêgeraga!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emw’Abayahudi, abanya-byâha bàkâgilolwa nka bantu ba lushomyo ntâye wa­nkabayegîre embere bacîyûnguze.</char></note> Oku bajà balibirha barhanamanyiri ngahi bayêrekîre, abanya-mahanga baderhe, obwo, mpu: «Abà ntâko bankacishinga nsiku eno mwîrhu!»<verse eid="LAM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16"/>Nyakasane yêne oyo wabashandâzagya, arhacilonza abalolekwo. Abadâhwa barhacilolagwa isù, ciru ntà bukenge bwaciri oku bashosi.<verse eid="LAM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17"/>Amasù gîrhu gàrhama gahengûza aha oburhabâle bwâyisha, bwanabulikana. Rhwageza amango goshi nti rhwalinda ishanja ly’ihanga lyâyishirhuciza, lirhanacirhucizagya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ishanja ly’ihanga ye Mîsiri bànywânanaga naye oku matabâro gâbo mazinda, Mîsiri naye arhayishaga okubarhabâla.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18"/>Badwîrhe bayunja enshando zîrhu, ntâkwo rhwankacihika aha mwîrhu. Amango gîrhu gahisire, ensiku zîrhu zahwîre, bulya obuzinda bwîrhu buli hôfi.<verse eid="LAM 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19"/>Abarhushimbire bo babidu kulusha ikozi lyabalala omu nkuba-karhî. Bajà barhulibirhakwo omu ntondo, bajà barhuhengûza ciru n’omu iru­ngu n’okurhurhega.<verse eid="LAM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20"/>Ngasi oyu akalamo kîrhu kàli kacisimikirekwo, oyu kàlicîkubagire, o­mwâmi washîgagwa amavurha na Nyakasane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwâmi Sedekyahu ye wayîmisirwe ayîrikwa ago mazîno: «Mushîgwa wa Nyakasane» Naye abashombanyi bamugwârha mpira, olubaga lwarhà omurhima, lwadaga. Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 25:6">2 Bâm 25, 6</ref></char>.</char></note>, ye rhwakagiderha, nti: «Ye rhwalamirakwo oyu omu karhî k’amashanja», y’oyo naye wagwaâsirwe mpira omu mwîna gw’omushombanyi!<verse eid="LAM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21"/>Osîmage onacîshinge, we munyere w’e Edomu, we yûbaka omu cihugo c’e Usi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cihugo ca Usi: co cirimwo abalungu ba bene Israheli, bo balimwo ba Mowabu, Amoni, ab’e Edomu (Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 36:28">Murh 36, 28</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:1">Ayu 1, 1</ref></char>). Nabo bali barhabâzi ba bene Israheli omu ntambala, babà kucîshinga bacîshingira okuhimwa kwa bene Israheli: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34:5">Iz 34, 5</ref></char>. Co càrhumaga bene Israheli bàkâgikaga Edomu omu myandiko y’Abalêbi, enyuma ly’okurhenga omu bujà e Babiloni: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 34">Iz 34</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25">Eze 25</ref></char>.</char></note>. Ci kwône nâwe akabehe k’omutula kâkuhikakwo, wâkanyweramwo onalaluke, kuhika oyambale obusha!<verse eid="LAM 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22"/>Obuhane bwâwe bwahwîre, we munyere w’e Siyoni, orhacihêkwe ebwa kululizibwa. Kuli we, wêhe munyere w’e Edomu, Nyakasane abâna amabî gâwe, ajalabule amabî gâwe goshi.<verse eid="LAM 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù ya karhanu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1"/>Nyakasane, orhayibagire okûla rhwabîre, olole obone kuno badwîrhe ba­rhujira<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endûlù ya karhanu omu Vulgata bàdesire oku gwo musengero gwa Yeremiya.</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2"/>Ebirugu bîrhu binjinjà byanyazirwe n’abandi, n’enyumpa zîrhu zàjibwa­mwo n’entakembûlwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Entakêmbûlwa bo barhali Buyahudi, abarhali b’omu bûko bwa bene-Israheli. Bulya Abayahudi bene Israheli hoshi bâli bakêmbûle (Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Murh 17, 10</ref>.<ref loc="GEN 17:24">24</ref></char>).</char></note>.<verse eid="LAM 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3"/>Balarha ntâbo bahali, na rhôno rhukola rhuli nfuzi na banyâma babîre bakana. <verse eid="LAM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4"/>Rhurhacinywa amîshi g’amaliba gîrhu rhurhanagaguziri nsaranga. N’e­nshagali ntà kucizibona rhurhanahyûziri igerha.<verse eid="LAM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5"/>Abanzi bîrhu rhubahêrhe aha mugongo, rhwalibwîre, rhwarhama, omu­rhûla gwarhuyâsire.<verse eid="LAM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6"/>Abanyamisri n’Abanyasîriya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abanyasîriya bo balama e Babeli.</char></note> bo rhukolaga rhurhega amaboko nti nkabaga bo bârhubonera ebyankarhubuka ishali.<verse eid="LAM 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7"/>Ababusi bîrhu bakolaga ago mabî barhacibâho, ci kwône rhwe rhukolaga rhubarhwîre amaligo haguma n’amazibu g’obugoma bwâbo.<verse eid="LAM 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8"/>Abàli bajà bîrhu bo bakolaga barhurhegeka, na ntâye ciru odesirage mpu arhulikûza kuli bo.<verse eid="LAM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9"/>Rhukola rhuja rhwahushwa n’ebishumûsi by’omu irungu erhi kujà kwalo­nza ebi rhwalya kurhuma.<verse eid="LAM 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10"/>Ecikoba c’omubiri gwîrhu cikola cirhuyôca nka kuno barhurhogeza omu cibeye c’omuliro, erhi kulumwa n’ishali kurhuma.<verse eid="LAM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11"/>Abakazi badwîrhe bakolerwa ebihigo omu Siyoni, n’abanyere kwo na kuguma, omu bishagala bya Yûda.<verse eid="LAM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12"/>Bagwâsire abarhambo banabamanika, barhanadesiri ciru mpu bakenge abashosi. <verse eid="LAM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13"/>Abâna b’emisole bakazibarhula olwanjikwa, oku abânarhabana bajà badandabagana n’emizigo y’enshâli.<verse eid="LAM 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14"/>Abashosi ntâho bacidwîrhe bajà omu ihano, n’emisole erhacihuma oku mulya gw’olulanga mpu yâziha.<verse eid="LAM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15"/>Ntà bushagaluke bucirhuli emurhima, okusâmira engoma kwîrhu kwahindusire mishîbo.<verse eid="LAM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16"/>ishungwè rhwagwêrhe oku irhwe lyàrhozire! Yajewe! Alà oku rhwabwîne rhwagomera Nyakasane!<verse eid="LAM 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17"/>Obu rhukola rhuhîrîre ntya oku nsholo y’omurhima, n’amasù garhurhûnzire n’emirenge:<verse eid="LAM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18"/>Kuli kubà bulya entondo ya Siyoni yahindusire irungu, ekola ebà bulu­mbà bwa banyambwè!<verse eid="LAM 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19"/>Ci kwône wêhe, Nyakasane, ôbà Mwâmi ensiku zoshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ciru akahà mpu aka-Nyamuzinda kâge k’en’igulu kamâshâbwa, Nyamuzinda-Nyakasane, ali Ogala-byoshi. Irenge lyâge liri ly’ensiku n’amango. Entebe yâge eri y’ensiku zirhaheka omu mpingu (Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:12">Lul 102, 12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:13">145, 13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:10">146, 10</ref></char>).</char></note>, we yôrha orhegeka omu myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="LAM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20"/>Cici cànkarhumire warhuyibagira lwoshi lwoshi? Cankarhuma waârhulekerera lwoshi lwoshi?<verse eid="LAM 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21"/>Orhugalule emunda oli, Yâgirwa Nyakasane, lyo rhushubira okunali lwoshi emunda oli; akalamo kîrhu oshubikajira kahyâhya nka kulya kwa mîra.<verse eid="LAM 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22"/>Kurhigi wankarhukabulira lwoshi lwoshi! Ka wanarhushombaga okungana âho?<verse eid="LAM 5:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5"/>
</usx>
